  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow the ability to set a timer on any specific user to block them from spamming invite requests. Its quite common to, for example, have to temporarily switch worlds with a friend then rejoin the original world if you needed to talk about something important or personal, and during that time, its also very possible, and common, to end up getting invite request spammed by the friends in the original world. The idea of this is that you could simply block that user from sending requests either for a set amount of time, until you switch worlds, or until you turn it back on. (sort of like how discord has an option for a timer on your status).",
